WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.870
Unfortunately... she's only going to live 'til next spring...

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:09.650
We came to make sure her fate wouldn't be changed, but...

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.740
...Mitsuki can now turn into the sixteen-year-old <i>Full Moon</i>.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:17.110
When she told her manager 
and her doctor about it...

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.690
...it seems like they somewhat believed her...

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:12.640
What's that?

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.890
You sure you didn't forget anything?

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:58.090
Yep!

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:01.460
Isn't it wonderful how you're getting out so early?

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:04.610
Yes, come in.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.070
D-Dr. Wakaouji!

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.530
Thank you for taking care of her!

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.940
S-Sure...

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.990
Madam told me to pass on her appreciation.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.180
Is that so?

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:17.250
How are you feeling?

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:17.840
Yep!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.360
I feel great!

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.320
Sensei, thank you for everything!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.260
You're still keeping the fact that you can 
change a secret from your grandma, right?

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:30.680
Ah... yeah...

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.700
Then...

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:33.520
Him, too?

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:34.740
Ah... yeah...

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.390
Well then... take care of yourself.

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:38.940
Ah, Dr. Wakaouji.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:42.070
Once I've gotten her settled in...

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.070
T-That's okay...

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.690
I have a patient to examine.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:45.880
Thanks, though.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.030
That doctor...

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:50.790
...seems like he doesn't like me...

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.000
T-That's just your imagination!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:53.580
Oh well...

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.290
I can't help it if he hates me.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.120
After all... I'm a Shinigami, and he's a doctor.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.500
Madam was so worried about you...

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.510
I was quite surprised.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:07.900
Really?

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.680
Please consider just how much you've 
imposed upon those who care about you!

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:21.690
First, Dr. Wakaouji had to take care of you.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:25.210
Everyone was running around looking for you.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.690
I'm really sorry.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.050
Really...

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.380
Be more careful about your health.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.060
Um...

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:39.910
How are you feeling, Grandma?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:42.500
It's just the heat that's getting me.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:44.050
There is no need to worry.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.360
I see...

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:48.800
I'll excuse myself.

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:54.260
Congratulations on getting released, Mitsuki. {scale}

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.720
Thank you, Ooshige-san!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:00.220
We'll start work again after 
things have calmed down, okay?

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:01.180
Sorry about that.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.320
Instead of that...

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:05.290
...be sure to apologize to everyone when you come back, okay?

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.150
Okay! {scale}

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.470
I'll get in touch with you again, then.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:09.380
Okay!

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:12.120
Hey! Stupid kid!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.450
Why the heck doesn't this room have any air conditioning?! {shani: Shinigami are a bit too demanding these days, eh?}

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:16.160
It's bad for my throat.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:19.620
Besides... we're at a high elevation, so there's a cool breeze.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.060
It isn't cool at all!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.290
Anyways...

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.570
What happened to Meroko? {shani: she became cloud no. 9 :D}

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.110
Who knows...

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:30.510
Takuto.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.910
Are you still mad?

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.930
What... you're not mad at her?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.530
It's her fault that you lost the audition.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:40.220
Meroko must have had her reasons...

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:42.080
T-That's true, but...

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.690
Thanks to Meroko, you...

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:44.190
But...

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:48.790
...because of that, I was able to tell 
Wakaouji-sensei and Ooshige-san everthing.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.650
I-I guess so.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:54.800
All that's left is for Meroko to come back...

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:57.660
Meroko...

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.330
Where did you go?

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.000
I didn't do anything wrong!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.550
I was just doing my duty as a Shinigami.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.640
What's wrong with that?!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.960
Takuto, you're such a jerk!

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:00.740
Good afternoon!

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.010
Yes, yes?

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.550
Wh-What is it?

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.940
Is Mitsuki-san here?

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:10.850
Yes?

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:12.900
We all came to see her!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.490
We were so surprised when we heard you were in the hospital.

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:19.490
But... isn't it great that you're all better now?

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:20.040
Yep.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.160
Thanks.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:21.870
Wow!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.080
That's such a big garden!

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.370
There's even a pond!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.790
It's amazing!

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:26.290
Hey!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.660
Can we take a look around?

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:28.250
Sure.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:33.380
Tanaka-san.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:34.670
Ah, madam.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.590
We have guests?

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:39.430
Yes, they're all friends of Mitsuki-san.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:44.390
This is the first time we've had so 
many people over... I was so surprised!

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:47.110
What?

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.890
There's a ghost story at our school?

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:51.940
Someone saw one in the gym at our school.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:52.860
No way!

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:54.600
In the dead of night...

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:57.030
In the empty gym...

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:58.890
A basketball goes... boom... boom... {alpha-time}

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:00.400
A basketball goes... boom... boom... {alpha-time}

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:01.620
A basketball goes... boom... boom... {alpha-time}

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:02.780
P-Please stop.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.530
I can't take this...

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.160
We've found Mitsuki's weakness!

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.250
This is all it takes, huh?

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:10.500
That's 'cause...!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.960
That ghost must be lonely.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:15.710
That's why it's waiting for someone to play with.

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:16.530
Eh?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.390
'Cause... you can't play basketball by yourself, right?

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.450
That's true...

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.150
You don't have to escort us out.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.040
You shouldn't stain yourself yet.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:38.610
Okay.

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:40.150
Thanks for coming today!

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:41.490
See you later then!

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:47.220
Ah... what an ordeal!

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.540
Hey, Takuto.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:49.080
Huh?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.040
What is it?

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.380
It's about Meroko...

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.670
Y-You're still talking about that...?!

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:55.040
You know... Meroko's... probably at school...

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.880
I don't want to hear it!

00:08:57.170 --> 00:08:58.360
Ah, Takuto!

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.170
Geez!

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.600
I'm tired of it...

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:28.280
Are you here, Meroko?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.000
T-This is bad!! {You can't hide, she can see you}

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.500
I can't move!

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.520
Are you all right, Meroko?

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.380
I'm fine.

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:41.970
What?

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.930
Takuto hasn't said anything?

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:44.670
Yeah.

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:46.550
He won't tell me when I ask him either.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.470
M-My reason... my reason was...

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.830
M-My reason... my reason was...

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.350
It doesn't matter.

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:52.670
After all, I didn't get hurt.

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:53.560
It's just...

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.480
When you're gone...

00:09:57.480 --> 00:10:01.380
...it feels like something's missing... something's wrong...

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.330
If the three of us aren't together...

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.330
If it's not the three of us, together, like before...

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.490
...it feels lonely.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:45.450
Okay.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:46.470
Let's go back together!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.700
I want to go back too...

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.580
I want to, but Takuto...

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:54.950
I'm sure that Takuto wants you to come back too.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.210
You think so?

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:57.710
Hmm?

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.630
You shouldn't have come back!

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:04.010
Why's that?!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.630
I'm finally alone with her now!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.640
In other words... you're a third wheel!

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:12.890
I-I can't!

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:15.150
It's better for Takuto if I'm not around...

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.060
Huh?

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:17.940
I-In any case... I can't go back.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:18.730
Bye.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:20.960
Meroko!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.420
Geez...

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.430
It's hot... it's uncomfortable...

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:42.090
It's hot... it's uncomfortable...

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.780
So hot...

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:48.890
D-Don't even think about it!

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.220
But... I haven't said anything yet!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.680
It's probably about Meroko anyways.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.090
Ah, you already knew.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.060
Well, you see...

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.640
...I want you to go bring Meroko back.

00:11:57.870 --> 00:11:59.100
She's at school...

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.200
Look here.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:03.240
Why do I have to bring her back?

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:05.480
If she wants to come back, she can come back on her own.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:05.940
Eh?

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:06.860
It's okay then?

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.410
T-That's Meroko's problem.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.760
It wasn't anything I did!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:13.780
I see.

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:15.220
You're right.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.410
W-Wait a second!

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:19.580
Did Takuto really say that it was okay?

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:20.600
He sure did.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.750
B-But...

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.050
Come on already...

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.130
But...

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:27.890
I don't know what I should say to him...

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.550
Wouldn't "I'm back!", be enough? {shani: OMG! Best convo between Meroko and Mistsuki! <3}

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:33.900
But I doubt that Takuto would say "Welcome back!"...

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.260
You're still saying that!

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:38.560
If you keep thinking like that... things will be like this forever!

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.730
Is that okay with you?!

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.880
Not really, but...

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.280
Wow!

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.530
What a blue sky!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.150
And white clouds, too!

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:51.570
It's so beautiful...

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:53.450
Hey Takuto, come look!

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:54.530
No point.

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:56.080
Besides... Shinigami...

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.700
...don't have "blue skies" or "white clouds", you know. {shani: yet they demand air conditioning :D}

00:12:58.700 --> 00:12:59.080
Ah...

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.380
I-Is that so...

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.600
Yes, it is.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.550
Meroko, come over here!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:12.860
Come on!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.750
The two of you...

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.650
Hello, Tomoe-chan?

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:25.730
Well...

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:27.650
I have a hypothetical question for you...

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:31.070
If two good friends aren't talking to each other...

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:32.570
...what should I do?

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:33.820
Hmm...

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:35.070
Maybe you could set them up?

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:37.100
What do you mean by set them up?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.830
Anything works.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.790
If you set them up...

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.500
...the rest is up to them.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.060
Set them up, huh...

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:45.980
Mitsuki-san.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.230
Are you going to stay on the phone forever?

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.470
Isn't a lengthy phone call a hassle for your friend?

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:53.530
Ah, yes.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:57.780
Ah!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.120
Hey, Tomoe-chan?

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.390
I don't mind.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:04.810
Really?!

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:06.680
Thank you so much!

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:09.240
Make sure you're ready in case of a fire.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.240
Have some water nearby.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:11.860
Okay!

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:13.170
Excuse me!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.910
Fireworks with her firends, huh?

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.620
That sounds like fun!

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.120
Ah... please excuse me.

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:21.770
I was too forward.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.500
There is nothing to apologize for.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.080
I-I suppose so.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:26.930
Ah...

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:27.750
By the way...

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:31.340
May I go and prepare something for the children?

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:32.430
Do as you wish.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.550
Yes!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.550
Eh?!

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:41.470
Real fireworks?!

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:42.220
Yep.

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:44.720
I have a fireworks set...

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:47.330
...but I want ones that go <i>Kaboom</i> !

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.230
I guess it's all right...

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:50.670
I'll be counting on you then!

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:53.650
Real fireworks?!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:54.200
Yep!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.060
Just one of the ones that goes <i>Kaboom</i> !

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:57.950
Hmm...

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.370
I suppose it's okay...

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:04.230
May we come in?!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.710
Ah! Welcome!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.340
Good evening.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.840
Mitsuki-chan's waiting for you.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:14.300
Come... it's this way.

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:15.010
Ah!

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.180
W-What is this?!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.680
A long Soumen!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:19.590
Yes.

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:21.820
Please... eat up, everyone!

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.640
This feels so nostalgic!

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:28.020
Hey, hey. You can eat soumen with ginger, right?

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.830
Eh? Our family uses mayonnaise, though.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.050
Welcome!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:34.950
Mitsuki!

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:36.110
So cute!

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:37.200
It's wonderful!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.200
You look beautiful, Mitsuki!

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:40.370
R-Really?

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.890
Thanks for inviting us today!

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:44.580
Everyone!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.450
It's about time to begin!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.040
Catch!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:51.880
Ah!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.150
I missed that one! {Fade}

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:09.480
It's pretty!

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:10.900
I wanna do one too!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.810
Wow!

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:18.820
It's beautiful!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.230
Ah?

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:45.890
Everyone, over here! {Summer rains, you can never predict them}

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:50.060
It's raining at a time like this...

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.000
It isn't stopping...

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.500
Why did it have to rain...

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.120
What?

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:11.290
It's just an evening shower...

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:12.460
It'll stop soon.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.380
I hope so...

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.090
Anyways... isn't this great?

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.590
You have all these friends now.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:18.450
Yep!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.720
It's all thanks to you and Meroko.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.630
You know... back when my CD came out...

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.290
Something like that happened as well...

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.270
And then...

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:34.100
When Meroko turned into me...

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.310
...and started selling CDs...

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:38.130
...I was wondering what would happen.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.410
She had us in a bind there.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.700
But... it was for the best.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.470
Yeah.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:45.780
You...

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:46.570
After hearing that...

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:49.350
Aren't you going to tell Meroko?

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.020
You found out?

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:54.220
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:55.000
But...

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.210
To tell you the truth...

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.130
The first friends I've ever made...

00:17:58.130 --> 00:17:59.690
...were you and Meroko.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:02.240
That's why...

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:05.470
...you two are very precious friends.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:10.160
I want you two to make up.

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:22.240
The rain stopped!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.180
Let's keep going!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.610
Okay. Let's launch the skyrockets!

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:00.230
All right!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:01.710
Do it! Do it!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:09.200
All right!

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:10.450
Now, right?

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:11.240
Go!

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:11.240
Go!

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:21.960
It's so cute!

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:24.050
It's a bunny and a cat!

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:25.510
W-What's that?

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.010
I only made a bunny...

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:34.600
That girl...

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.750
I understand.

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:41.170
Hey, Meroko.

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:44.780
Takuto... I...

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:50.620
You... won't forgive me... will you?

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:51.160
Bye!

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.140
Hold on!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:55.520
Don't just assume what someone else is feeling.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.690
Then... you'll forgive me?

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.310
Let's do that... you know?

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.380
It's absurd to hide our name 
when our cover is blown...

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.890
We... who will even lie to crying children...

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:11.890
The Shinigami Duo!

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:14.180
Takuto!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.190
Meroko!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.560
With out powers combined... we are...

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.560
With out powers combined... we are...

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.750
Spring Onion Ramen!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.750
Spring Onion Ramen!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.830
I'm so glad.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:26.920
What is it, Mitsuki?

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.820
I'm glad that...

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:32.670
...that there were spring onion ramen fireworks... something like that.

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.970
What are you saying... silly Mitsuki.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.730
What am I saying...

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:47.840
Good night! {Mitsuki}

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:49.470
Be careful on the way home!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.460
Mitsuki-san.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.770
Did everyone go home after having a good time?

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:56.790
Yeah...

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.690
That's good.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.170
But, Mitsuki-san...

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:03.000
You are still recovering from your illness.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:05.560
Dress warmly and go to sleep.

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:06.500
Ah, okay.

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:07.550
That is all.

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:09.670
Grandma.

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:11.240
What is it?

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:14.200
Thanks for always worrying about me!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.600
Takuto! Meroko!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.800
It looks like Grandma and me...

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.770
...are going to get along just fine!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:27.380
Is that so?

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:28.530
Sure is.

00:23:05.770 --> 00:23:06.640
Ah!

00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:08.150
Geez! She's so <i>irritating</i> !

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:10.480
That Wakamatsu Madoka is back again!

00:23:10.480 --> 00:23:10.980
Hey.

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:14.440
Why are you going so far as to call that Madoka an enemy?

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:16.240
She might be a surprisingly good person. {that's much later}

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:17.450
There's no way!

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:19.410
The one who tore apart her costume...

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:21.410
It was definitely that Madoka's doing!

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:22.160
Anyways...

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:24.380
This isn't the time to be saying that!

00:23:24.580 --> 00:23:26.210
She goes back to work today!

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:28.250
We have to be there for her!

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:30.460
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:32.130
New Feelings
